WEBVTT

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.980
Then you belong to one of the 
Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts?

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.240
I'm Hinozuka, Nachi Hinozuka.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.020
What brings a member of 
the Four Houses here?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.370
Well, I've got my reasons.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.800
Shino!

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.620
The cherry trees! The cherry trees!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.130
This strange atmosphere... 
We're in a barrier.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.710
A barrier?

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:37.140
That mountain yesterday... with 
the forest of cherry trees...

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.550
It's making the barrier, isn't it?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.270
Something is happening, but 
only around Daikaku's house.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.830
Did you make this barrier?

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.270
Ask that there cat, not me.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:59.030
Goodness! Where the blazes did he go?

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.440
Hey! Stop!

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.290
Wait up!

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:16.300
I'm certain that this 
is where that man...

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.550
No!

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.640
But I was also stabbed...

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:26.030
What the hell happened?!

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.030
What's wrong with you?!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.850
I need you to keep blooming!

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:06.020
Molding

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.710
Please try a bit harder!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:10.190
Looks like you're the one behind 
this barrier of cherry blossoms.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.270
Why the heck would you-

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.790
Shut up! Get away from here!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.670
Don't get any closer to Daikaku!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:21.340
You're Daikaku's old cat, aren't you?

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.280
Are you trying to protect Daikaku?

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.560
Why do you care about him so much?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.180
Daikaku gave me a name!

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.550
A name?

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.310
But he doesn't remember your name.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.170
So what if he doesn't?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.070
I know that Daikaku gave me a name!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.800
That's good enough for me!

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.180
Ow, ow...

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.120
Why...?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.570
Man, this is gonna fall over!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:53.720
The trunk's rotten.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.250
What?!

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.380
It's my fault...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:02.880
I pushed it too hard, asking 
it to bloom every single day...

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.370
I...

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.920
D-don't cry! Calm down!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.150
Sheesh! Like cryin' is gonna help.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.150
Check this out!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:29.660
Don't!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.010
Wha-?!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.830
Wh-what... have you done?!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:58.200
All of the trees around 
here were already dead.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.150
Look!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.230
Whether I did that or not, this 
woulda happened sooner or later.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.510
What should I do?

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.630
Without the barrier, 
he's bound to come back!

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.660
Huh? Who is?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.360
Daikaku can't fight him...

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.420
Daikaku's in danger!

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.270
Hey!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:28.570
Daikaku...

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:30.430
My son...

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:33.080
Daikaku...

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.660
Now I remember...

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.480
How could I have forgotten until now?

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:40.460
Brother...

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:44.440
Hinaginu, Pa never went missing.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.200
He passed away!

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.020
And then that man came.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:55.200
Long time no see, Daikaku.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:05.460
With Norikiyo dead, now we 
can finally live together!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.590
Sound good?

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:07.820
Please leave.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:09.840
I am not giving you a single doll.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.220
They are the embodiment 
of Pa's very soul!

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.850
Ya really shouldn't go talkin' 
that way to yer own father.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:22.090
Norikiyo took ya from 
me against my will.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.860
I'm sure ya remember me, dun ya?

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.710
Yes, I remember you well.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:33.370
You were a loathsome man 
unfit to be a father!

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:34.870
What was that?

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.000
Make yourself scarce.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:39.810
Daikaku!

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:49.010
Aw, what a waste!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.760
I coulda made a bundle if ya were alive.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.390
Too late now. I'll just 
help myself to the dolls.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.450
Don't touch... them!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.550
Am I going to die?

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.150
Brother, no!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.910
Hinaginu, your asthma...

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.880
You need your medicine now...

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:24.800
Oh, it's you? You've come back?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:29.170
Say, could you give 
Hinaginu her medicine?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:34.180
And please protect the 
dolls from that man...

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.010
I need to feed and water you...

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:45.260
I... don't want to die and leave...

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.320
...so much behind...

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:56.030
Gratitude

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.910
I'm sure that I died back there.

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.440
Yet when I awoke, the wound 
had completely vanished!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.040
And then I found his...

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.930
Why was that man dead?

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:26.440
Daikaku is... my son...

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.440
Daikaku,

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.570
you have a most unusual guest out front.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:38.600
Sorry, but could you look 
after my sister for a minute?

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.330
Brother?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:43.710
If he's an unwelcome guest, 
should I chase him away?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.710
No. As his son, I should go.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:48.980
Very well.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.600
You always return at 
just the right time.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.350
Shino?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.250
Whoa! What is that?!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.200
Murasame!

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:14.110
Wait!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.860
It isn't your place to interfere.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.240
Why'd you stop me?! That's a monster!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.230
But Daikaku doesn't see him as such.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:27.500
That is Mr. Norikiyo Inumura.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:35.630
Daikaku is... my son!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.090
I am terribly sorry, Pa!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:43.890
I have been a burden to you, 
Pa, because of that man.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.170
Dolls...

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:51.160
I swear I will recover all 
of the dolls that man sold!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:53.280
So you don't need to worry about them.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:57.910
I will be sure to protect all 
of the dolls you left behind.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:03.540
I am not ready to die yet!

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:10.420
The dolls... No one can have them!

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.920
I don't want to die!

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.710
Daikaku!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.670
Pa...

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.520
At this rate, he's gonna get absorbed!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.990
Daikaku!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.150
At this rate, he's gonna get absorbed!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:34.530
Daikaku!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.940
He was trying to protect Daikaku...

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.590
...from the monster Norikiyo had become.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:23.740
Ya see, pet cats are 
surprisingly devoted.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:33.890
Noro...

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.200
Daikaku...

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.850
Is "Noro" the name of that cat?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.030
And here you said that 
he didn't have a name!

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:01.310
I know... I had completely 
forgotten about it.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:03.860
Say what?! Talk about cold!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.450
You certainly are a strange child.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.750
Yeah, I guess.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.510
Daikaku, when that monster 
said, "I don't want to die,"

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:20.160
you considered trading places 
with it for a second, didn't you?

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:27.970
I understand my father's passion 
for dolls better than anyone.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:32.220
I'll admit that if that's what he 
wanted, I was willing to comply.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.210
That isn't your father.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.640
It's simply a body of thoughts.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.310
So don't get any crazy 
ideas like that ever again.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:48.830
Sheesh!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:52.410
Do you have any idea how hard 
that cat worked to protect you?

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:54.900
What now?

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:56.220
Nothing.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.570
I was merely thinking that you 
truly are a peculiar child.

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:01.490
I'm sick of hearing that!

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.150
And you aren't the least bit charming.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.430
Whatever! Just hurry 
and finish those dolls!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:11.430
I wonder how Shii and 
the guys are doing.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.940
Rio, don't you think it is 
about time you retrieved them?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.610
I suppose I must.

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:21.080
I cannot let Master Finnegan 
impose upon us further.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.510
I am honored to have the Osaki 
Goko Five Foxes pour my wine!

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.530
I wonder why Master Finnegan sen

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.710
t Shii and Sosuke to fetch the dolls.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.440
Probably because Nachi 
has never returned.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.850
That's it?

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:43.710
You don't think he's realized 
that Shii is special to you?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.220
"Special" in what way?

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.960
It is hardly like you to become 
their guardian simply due

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.890
to their involvement with 
Otsuka Village, Rio.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:00.500
I felt obligated to do so.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.660
"Obligated"?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:04.790
You make it sound as if Shii 
is one of your relatives...

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.560
Whoa, wait!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:11.710
Ah! So that's the deal?

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:17.750
Hence I came here as per 
Ol' Finnegan's request.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:22.250
And my cat is going through a 
rebellious stage and refuses to leave.

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.780
Before I knew it, half a year'd passed.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.610
How dare you call this 
a "rebellious stage"?!

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:29.140
Please don't treat me like a kitten!

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:35.600
No wonder that old man grew 
impatient and sent you.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.020
So that's the story...

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:41.010
I wanna stay here forever!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:44.530
They don't have pesky foxes, 
treacherous snakes or doggies here!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:46.930
What is it?

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:51.090
I just remembered something...

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:59.230
No!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.760
Whoa, Yatsufusa!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:00.040
You can't fit into this puny room!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.630
Another unusual creature 
has appeared at our home.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.070
Indeed...

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.710
Get off, Yatsufusa!

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:08.220
I'm sorry, but I believe one more 
guest will be arriving shortly...

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.550
Would it be possible for you 
to prepare another room?

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.290
Satomi!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.170
Shino...

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.230
This area is kinda confusing, 
so I came to lead the way!

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:29.010
It's pretty rare for 
you to go on an errand!

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:32.200
The child I had sent is 
taking his dearie time.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:34.930
He is making the old man grow impatient.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.610
Don't blame me!

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:38.580
The dolls aren't ready yet.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.070
That aside, I've got 
something I wanna show you.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.720
Here's proof...

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.610
...that back then, the woman 
who wiped out Otsuka Village

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:57.100
also passed through here.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.870
After seeing this face, 
I finally remembered her.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.650
There's no mistake!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.480
She is the one who killed us...

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:13.490
What the-?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.620
I suddenly... feel dizzy!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:39.890
What happened?

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:42.270
What was I gonna tell you?

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.440
Shino, you may put it out of your mind.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:03.390
Fuke yuku aki no yo
The autumn night is advancing

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:08.110
Tabi no sora no
 Alone, I lament over

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:13.950
Wabishiki omoi ni
 The forlorn feelings I have

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:18.370
Hitori nayamu
 While traveling under this sky

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.370
Who taught you that song?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.720
Daddy!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.350
Yoshiro should sing along!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.330
Yoshiro should?

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:32.590
Koishiya furusato
How I pine for home

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:36.550
Natsukashi chichi haha
 I miss my mother and father

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:42.870
Yumeji ni tadoru wa
 If I followed the path in my dreams

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:46.800
Sato no ieji
 It would take me home

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:53.130
Fuke yuku aki no yo
 The autumn night is advancing

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:57.840
Tabi no sora no
 Alone, I lament over

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:04.410
Wabishiki omoi ni
 The forlorn feelings I have

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:08.670
Hitori nayamu
 While traveling under this sky

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.160
Are you Master Daikaku Inumura?

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.060
Sorry for coming without due warning.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.810
I came in regard to 
Lord Finnegan's order.

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.670
I am Rio Satomi.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:26.290
Is there a problem?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:31.050
Uh, no! About those dolls...

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.280
Sorry, but please give me one more day.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:36.300
I just need to carve the faces.

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.670
That would be fine.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:40.680
Master Satomi?

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:43.420
Shino! What happened to him?

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:44.880
He seems to be somewhat tired.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:47.620
Hinaginu, I have work to attend to.

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.310
See to our guests.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:53.920
Okay!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.160
Gratitude

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.920
This must have been with Noro...

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:29.850
Gratitude

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:29.170
He always loved round things, didn't he?

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:36.060
Looking at this, I am not surprised 
Shino's memories resurfaced.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:38.270
Princess Fuse...

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.160
The Satomi family's legendary 
princess priestess.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.990
That legendary princess is 
now the symbol of disaster.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:49.370
Is that why you sealed 
that kid's memories?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:51.890
Yeah.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:10.140
Sorry to have kept you 
waiting for so long.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.820
I finished the set this 
morning without incident.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.900
You will find it in here.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:19.720
Please give my regards to 
the client, Master Finnegan.

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:22.090
I apologize for pushing you like this.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:23.350
What gives?

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:25.910
You were so adamant 
that it was beyond you!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:26.660
Shino!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:31.270
I found Master Satomi's visit 
to be of tremendous assistance.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.190
Thank you for coming.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.360
Man!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:38.300
This means the end of my 
all-you-can-eat beef days!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:40.470
You've had plenty!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.800
Please feel free to drop 
by whenever you like.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.180
Oh, yes! Inukai!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.260
I was hoping Kona-ya's 
innkeeper could assist

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.230
me with something in the near future.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.180
Yes?

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:54.850
To be honest, I am thinking about 
moving to the Imperial Capital.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.110
It would simplify the 
commissions process,

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:00.800
and above all else, I want 
to send Hinaginu to school.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.930
Understood. I will let her know.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.870
Knowing that innkeeper, I 
am sure she will help you.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:08.950
I appreciate it.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.940
Her inn is just across this road.

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:13.620
Yeah.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:21.340
Even so, you want to be with him, huh?

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:25.520
I hope that your wish comes true...

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.820
Just what I would expect 
of Inumura's dolls!

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.530
I'm glad I sent that boy.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:50.860
In front of that lad, his stony 
face always seems to soften...

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.770
Now then, where should I put this?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
Reverse Flow

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:28.610
Isn't that a bit sad?

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:31.050
He's being run ragged all because 
of that mere human's wish.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.170
You spirits hang out with 
us 'cause you want to.

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:34.260
You shouldn't complain.

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:37.580
You have no idea how we feel, you brat!

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:40.680
K-Kaede, not the face! Your paws hurt!
